cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this repository for its observation utilities and cite MyoSuite for the physical model."
type: software
title: Musculoskeletal Hand Simulation
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
authors:
  - family-names: Florido Gomez
    given-names: Santiago
repository-code: https://github.com/Santiago23florido/Musculoskeletal-Hand-Simulation
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Independent infrastructure for loading, inspecting and visualizing the official
  MyoSuite musculoskeletal hand in MuJoCo. The physical model belongs to its
  upstream authors. This software adds anatomical inventory and physical-state access.
